    thinking: "**Defining App Name and Strings**\n\nI\'m focused on the app\'s identity, nailing down the best name and string management for \"PW Manager\" (or PocketVault). I\'m considering how the name will look on the top app bar, including the vault icon, and I want to make sure the user experience is clean and intuitive from the start. \"PW Manager\" or \"PocketVault\"? That is the question!\n\n\n**Analyzing Metadata and Rules**\n\nI\'ve hit a roadblock and am now analyzing the prompt\'s metadata. I\'ve realized I\'m in planning mode, which means I need to ask for more context before proceeding. The instructions are clear: ask questions, wait for answers, then plan. This involves a skill check and then calling view file. I\'ll execute that plan.\n\n\n**Assessing Skills for Planning**\n\nI\'ve just finished the skill assessment. The goal is to identify relevant skills for planning the app development. App icon generation, design guidelines, and image generation are definitely relevant, whereas the rest aren\'t. Now, I\'ll be moving on to planning the next steps, based on these identified skills.\n\n\n"
