            lines {
              text: "PW Manager is a secure, 100% offline personal password vault built with Kotlin, Jetpack Compose, and Material Design 3. It features AES-256-GCM authenticated encryption, Android Keystore-backed biometrics (`BiometricPrompt` with `CryptoObject`), master password recovery, password generation, category filtering, search, and encrypted backup/restore."
