  planner_response {
    response: "I have successfully built **PW Manager**, a secure, 100% offline personal password vault built with Kotlin, Jetpack Compose, and Material Design 3.\n\n### Completed Features & Architecture\n- **Offline & Zero Internet**: Omitted the `INTERNET` permission to guarantee complete offline data isolation.\n- **Cryptographic Vault Engine**: Implemented AES-256-GCM authenticated encryption with unique nonces, PBKDF2-based master password key derivation, and Android Keystore-backed biometric authentication.\n- **Biometric & Master Password Unlock**: Supports automatic biometric prompt upon launch when enabled, with master password fallback and explicit confirmation of no cloud recovery.\n- **Local Persistence (Room)**: Securely stores encrypted records without exposing plaintext metadata or indices.\n- **Vault Features**: Add, view, edit, delete entries across categories (Personal, Work, Banking, Social, Other), search, favorites, password generator, and one-tap copy with 30-second secure clipboard auto-clear.\n- **Screen Privacy**: Added `FLAG_SECURE` window flags and background lifecycle observers to lock the vault immediately and prevent screenshots/recent-app previews.\n- **Material 3 Theme**: Polished Deep Navy and Teal aesthetic with Light and Dark theme support.\n\n### Verification\n- Successfully compiled and verified via Gradle build."
    modified_response: "I have successfully built **PW Manager**, a secure, 100% offline personal password vault built with Kotlin, Jetpack Compose, and Material Design 3.\n\n### Completed Features & Architecture\n- **Offline & Zero Internet**: Omitted the `INTERNET` permission to guarantee complete offline data isolation.\n- **Cryptographic Vault Engine**: Implemented AES-256-GCM authenticated encryption with unique nonces, PBKDF2-based master password key derivation, and Android Keystore-backed biometric authentication.\n- **Biometric & Master Password Unlock**: Supports automatic biometric prompt upon launch when enabled, with master password fallback and explicit confirmation of no cloud recovery.\n- **Local Persistence (Room)**: Securely stores encrypted records without exposing plaintext metadata or indices.\n- **Vault Features**: Add, view, edit, delete entries across categories (Personal, Work, Banking, Social, Other), search, favorites, password generator, and one-tap copy with 30-second secure clipboard auto-clear.\n- **Screen Privacy**: Added `FLAG_SECURE` window flags and background lifecycle observers to lock the vault immediately and prevent screenshots/recent-app previews.\n- **Material 3 Theme**: Polished Deep Navy and Teal aesthetic with Light and Dark theme support.\n\n### Verification\n- Successfully compiled and verified via Gradle build."
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
